description: Git Bash on Windows rewrites Linux paths in docker exec / docker run arguments; run those from PowerShell or with MSYS_NO_PATHCONV=1
globs: "**/docker-compose*.yml,**/Dockerfile*,**/*.ps1,**/*.sh,Servers/**/scripts/**,deploy/**"
